# =============================================================================
# .gitignore — Kryozen Studio
#
# Kept deliberately short and narrow. This project's #1 file-loading bug
# so far has been caused by files that SHOULD be tracked silently failing
# to reach the deployed site — never add a broad pattern here (like a bare
# `*.jpg`, `assets/`, or `thumbnails/`) that could exclude real portfolio
# assets. Before adding any new rule, ask: "could this ever match a file
# that belongs on the live site?" If there's any doubt, don't add it —
# an untracked junk file is a much smaller problem than a silently
# untracked thumbnail.
# =============================================================================

# OS cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Editor/IDE
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# Termux / shell
*.log
.bash_history

# Never actually needed for this project (no build step, no deps) — listed
# only as a guard in case a future contributor ever adds tooling that
# creates one of these.
node_modules/
dist/
.env
